{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d246cf539c2426b98f269322ddd8b02eb583fb1b9b060c51afa53564e903f6a7", "ja": "（桃子が近代西洋が舞台の映画に出演する。わがままな\nお嬢様を演じることになり、その衣装が届いた……）", "zh": "（桃子要出演一部以近代西方为舞台的电影。她要饰演一位任性的大小姐，服装也送到了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "f94ae7f4fae2bc055d246623897398c8efcb1370dcd414764193f5db46307652", "ja": "このポーズだと、こう見えるんだね。ふふ♪\n……じゃあ、この動きはどうかな？", "zh": "摆出这个姿势的话，看起来就是这样啊。呵呵♪\n……那么，这个动作怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dde1b4810b5ae12e76f5339af4efd25ea8588087f06b6ef4f6d02080cf8431e7", "ja": "お疲れさま、桃子。\nおお！　本当にお嬢様みたいだな！", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。\n哦哦！真的很像大小姐啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "0c4cd4fda90c3f74f358c75601e0275143dab47750475d35fc734e714d4d4498", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、ちょうどいいところに。……どう、\nこの動き？　上品だけど活発な感じ、伝わるかな？", "zh": "哥哥，你来得正好。……怎么样，\n这个动作？既优雅又活泼的感觉，能传达出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a337b33f9fe793b2dff8a876fc22e9baa0dc8a07cc84f0d9c6c9d74005386300", "ja": "ああ。きれいな動きの中にも、\n元気な感じがして、いいと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。在优美的动作中也透着活力，我觉得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "8893a16f3d70a8adbd2d747ebb569e373b6d2be604f98cded8b09c109e1d4475", "ja": "ふーん……お兄ちゃんにそう見えるなら、\n演技に取り入れてみるのもいいかもね。", "zh": "嗯……既然哥哥看起来是这样的，那也可以试着融入表演里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1006_p", "source_sha256": "03c6901ad4b1effd5fd30e435ea2a2757aa1a31300fa87cdf33f3fd593488b11", "ja": "しかし、すごいな。衣装を着て、\nすぐに動きのことを考えてるなんて……。", "zh": "不过，真厉害啊。穿上服装后，马上就开始考虑动作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "806702e699ece48dfe645607e44fa0bf6c3cee172e7bae82f28c465a97bfdcfb", "ja": "何いってるの、お兄ちゃん。\n桃子の役は、活発でちょっと素直じゃないお嬢様だよ。", "zh": "说什么呢，哥哥。桃子饰演的角色，是个活泼又有点不坦率的大小姐哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "0098cba13926bcabb0a2d34e2c1d9637a1335d352bf223e87ac17db8e1cedc6c", "ja": "演技の練習は、いつでもできるけど。どういう風に\n見えるかは、衣装を着てみないとわからないしね。", "zh": "演技练习随时都可以做。不过，穿上服装之前，也不知道看起来会是什么样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1009_p", "source_sha256": "46c90efe14a44aec038022a53a7cdce3a6d6c44dda00b228b3b9eff2d31a43c6", "ja": "確かに……。でも最後の社交界のシーンは、\nお淑やかなレディとして成長してるんだよな？", "zh": "确实……。不过最后的社交界那场戏，\n她是作为举止优雅的淑女成长起来的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "5b05220fae809230fd8ad193a9f3328a8f738e42aec54d90cf21c5f301b50f94", "ja": "うん。あとで、そっちの練習もするつもりだよ。\nクライマックスの一番失敗できないシーンだもん。", "zh": "嗯。之后我也打算练习那部分。\n毕竟那可是高潮部分最不能失败的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "46aafb2da6fad6f382e731758c42db7a76ba5528c8160bd7a28639455208731d", "ja": "レディになった姿を見てもらう大事な場面……。\n桃子に求められてるのは、その説得力なんだから。", "zh": "让大家看到桃子成为淑女后的模样，是很重要的场面……  \n桃子被要求的，正是那种说服力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1012_p", "source_sha256": "258d52dc0e3679d04882352174e90a3ea71e082c3a297c30a343a39cef5636af", "ja": "そうだな。……あれ？\nそれなら活発な演技の練習は今しなくても……。", "zh": "是啊。……咦？\n既然这样，现在不练习活泼的演技也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "8d5d10a8571e6014fad197a57df68533df476ca3bd5f6a95f038d0f393a34b1d", "ja": "お兄ちゃん！　プロの女優は、\n台本にない場面のことも考えなきゃダメなんだよ！", "zh": "哥哥！专业女演员也必须考虑剧本里没有的场景才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f2b520ea3bf743cd1ac7f862fd6bbda7c34a480c816efec6353d7fdf47550246", "ja": "そうか。てっきり、衣装を気に入って少しでも\nたくさん着たい……みたいなのもあるのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。我还以为，你是因为喜欢这套服装，想着能多穿一会儿……之类的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a6e7dfb9ea72cd68019b948cae7192ea171cce14235ae469ac6b5828e38dfce", "ja": "そ、それは……ちょっとはそういう気持ちもあった\nけど……だってすっごくきれいで素敵な衣装だし。", "zh": "也、也不是完全没有那种想法……毕竟是那么漂亮又棒的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "4ed50ccb8f885b5dd8a41de38acb27ec4c6cb5dd36a82c90c8791e338a307721", "ja": "そ、それよりお兄ちゃん、桃子いっぱい動いたから\n喉が渇いてきちゃったんだけど。", "zh": "先不说那个，哥哥，桃子刚才动了好多，现在有点口渴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9ee82b505604b03567dad0afc0d99aac2c5c8941c300d8c2757d4c1590f3f539", "ja": "ははっ、わかったよ。\nすぐに持ってくるけど……ジュースでいいか？", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。\n我马上拿过来……果汁可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "9fbefee4920f9fc4d3e569f0e0574b06ef917fc38bb3b7a0e3317708d7a64ee7", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。お兄ちゃん、\n映画での桃子の役、忘れたの？", "zh": "不是那样。哥哥，你忘了桃子在电影里的角色吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6005e21c4958f251798af0245a928e2923a5c25473aa5c679138250ebed7731c", "ja": "え？　……あっ。コホン。「ただちに、\n冷たいオレンジジュースをご用意いたします。お嬢様」", "zh": "咦？……啊。咳咳。“我马上为您准备冰橙汁。小姐。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0544_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "ef0338fa41a2e305fae69e07569df86216d3c8f67094de412cc44cb8628a1195", "ja": "よろしくってよ。でも急がないと、\nもっと命令しちゃうかも。気をつけてね、お兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "就拜托你啦。不过要是不快点的话，\n我可能还会下达更多命令哦。小心点呀，大哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
